{"parse":{"title":"Nature's Chorus","pageid":395634,"revid":2136181,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Nature&#39;s Chorus</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b4/Talent_Dendro_Moonsign_Lunar-Bloom.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024347\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Nature&#39;s Chorus\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b4/Talent_Dendro_Moonsign_Lunar-Bloom.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024347\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b4/Talent_Dendro_Moonsign_Lunar-Bloom.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024347 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b4/Talent_Dendro_Moonsign_Lunar-Bloom.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024347 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Nature&#39;s Chorus\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Nature%27s_Chorus.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Nature&#39;s Chorus.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lauma\" title=\"Lauma\">Lauma</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonsign_Benediction_Passive\" title=\"Moonsign Benediction Passive\">Moonsign Benediction Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Passive_Talent\" title=\"Passive Talent\">Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When a <a href=\"/wiki/Bloom\" title=\"Bloom\">Bloom</a> reaction is triggered by a <a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">party</a> member, it will be converted into the <a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Bloom\" title=\"Lunar-Bloom\">Lunar-Bloom</a> reaction, with every point of <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a> that Lauma has increasing Lunar-Bloom's Base DMG by 0.0175%, up to a maximum of 14%.<br /><br />Additionally, when Lauma is in the party, the party's <a href=\"/wiki/Moonsign\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Moonsign\">Moonsign</a> will increase by 1 level.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"scale_att1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Scaling</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Bloom_Enabler_and_Base_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Bloom Enabler and Base DMG Bonus\">Lunar-Bloom Enabler and Base DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar_Reaction_Enabling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar Reaction Enabling\">Lunar Reaction Enabling</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Nature's Chorus</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Lauma\" title=\"Lauma\">Lauma</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Moonsign_Benediction_Passive\" title=\"Moonsign Benediction Passive\">Moonsign Benediction Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNature%2527s_Chorus%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Nature's Chorus</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">千籁恩宠</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Qiānlài Ēnchǒng</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Grace of a Thousand Sounds</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">千籟恩寵</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Qiānlài Ēnchǒng</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">千響の恩寵</span><br /><small><i>Senchou no Onchou</i></small></td><td>Grace of a Thousand Sounds</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">자연의</span> <span lang=\"ko\">은총</span><br /><small><i>Jayeonui Eunchong</i></small></td><td>Grace of Nature</td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Coro de la naturaleza</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Ch<span lang=\"fr\">œ</span>ur de la nature</td><td>Nature's Chorus</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Хор</span> <span lang=\"ru\">природы</span><br /><small><i>Khor prirody</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Nature's Chorus</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Ân Sủng Ngàn Âm</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Gunst der tausend Melodien</td><td>Grace of a Thousand Melodies</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Nature's Chorus</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>Gra<span lang=\"pt\">ç</span>a da Cacofonia</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Do<span lang=\"tr\">ğ</span>an<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>n Korosu</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Coro della natura</td><td>Nature's Chorus</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNature%2527s_Chorus%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&a